{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "5cc839a85fc8d5ef21cd07b62bac6e9569f5416fba79a6dbb619ebaaca49914c", "ja": "あっ！？　あっちの空に、光るものが……！\nでもUFOっぽくないかも？　……あっ、あれはっ！？", "zh": "啊！？那边的天空上，好像有什么在发光……！\n不过可能不像UFO？……啊，那是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "40db1d9dc2ae1dc75881b1a2b171b1187247cc4e1bc2d7f091458301c39ba7d5", "ja": "……青羽さん？　お疲れさまです。\n空を見上げて、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "……青羽小姐？辛苦了。\n抬头看着天空，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "8da30edb38b45930660eeb355d94e55f4d98a9657a7052a49347e6c8561a91e9", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}さん！？\nええと、その……ちょっと空模様を見ていて。えへへ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n那个……我刚才在看天气。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bd46f96ac67725690d3dca6f09d3256c1145d3a0f75294373116934a68c6c7ac", "ja": "そうなんですか？\nでも今、UFOとか言ってませんでした？", "zh": "是这样吗？\n不过，您刚才是不是说了什么UFO之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "b271d8b3558cdf066dd78a05a5b0077e906ecc664145bca692e8d2f506edd624", "ja": "あっ……も、もう、{$P$}さん！\n聞いてたなら言ってください！　うぅ……恥ずかしい。", "zh": "啊……真、真是的，{$P$}先生！\n既然您都听到了，就请说一声嘛！呜……好难为情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "549cbe01063e50fb367e317e3bb97d95d396ccd1f5acedb59787031850fab27c", "ja": "今、『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』のことを\n思い出していたんです。それで、つい……。", "zh": "刚才，我想起了《☆噼里啪啦星球☆》的事。然后，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3396724070c6a965a79866643391f7d881fa76f4dfe666167c225ad0c0bc7903", "ja": "なるほど、それでUFOですか。\nいい番組でしたもんね。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才是UFO啊。\n那可是很棒的节目呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "3414a9a2b87dec94d5702ab74ab817726036ba6ec77857c5b0f8e7c8feed3a89", "ja": "そうなんです！\n私もすっかり、『せんのー』されちゃいました♪", "zh": "就是这样！\n我也完全被“洗脑”了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "813722c78edb9c4904b140f801d188127968a3e90c25952b12c26941a57907c3", "ja": "子ども向けの番組なのに、大人が見ても楽しくて。\n恥ずかしながら、夢中になってしまって……。", "zh": "明明是面向小孩子的节目，大人看了也觉得很有趣。\n虽然有点不好意思，但我看得特别入迷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f50880c34951ad628fae12d6fc503db0e8d242b8c7b6891e01f1ecc450f9e6c7", "ja": "恥ずかしがることはないと思いますよ。\nUFOや宇宙人だって、本当にいるかもしれませんし！", "zh": "我觉得没什么好难为情的。\n毕竟UFO和外星人，说不定真的存在呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "9190bb3d8be672a7979243f4bbfb3d7904b914129c49f092187bb880d0c42a6d", "ja": "ふふっ♪　{$P$}さんも、\n結構ロマンチストですよね！", "zh": "呵呵♪{$P$}先生也挺浪漫的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "18610a2432e3dea96132cbb09cfc866b386647ffae2c02487b0667034c290e03", "ja": "まあ、プロデューサーはそういうものかもしれません。\n夢を扱う仕事ですから。", "zh": "哎，制作人可能就是这样的吧。\n毕竟这是一份经营梦想的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "a3fd58f26024dd1a0d0273079e1d1961fc5d437c8e468b3bca9c1a073c1c5639", "ja": "なるほど、なるほど……あ、そうそう！\n仕事といえば……社長さんが、またお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此……啊，对了！\n说到工作……社长先生又叫您过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "21be22b07468c86cc508cc4691b8947ea0d9f7f57e09e8e755261f3aaa08bee7", "ja": "おっ、ということは、新しい案件かな？\nちょっと行ってきますね！", "zh": "哦，也就是说，有新的工作安排吗？\n我去看一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "30deb60f23782e33d5d59fac771ffb1d1498089034326a5262a78a2257e16140", "ja": "社長、お疲れさまです！　お呼びいただいたとか？", "zh": "社长，您辛苦了！听说您找我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "214820d47b0c3b1db135cdf91a9a26c9f84f734e113fd56b731703bfe9d1ac08", "ja": "うむ！　よく来てくれたね。\nいやー、君が喜んでくれると思って待ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯！你来得正好。\n哎呀～想着你会高兴，我可是一直等在这呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "ff6d9623410d6b929693579416b811484fe6db035662d31fde95f061e1dc3ef1", "ja": "実は……\nあの伝説の番組の、リバイバルが決定したのだよ！", "zh": "其实……\n那个传说级的节目，已经决定要重播了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1b9f24074d72589694f4483323fb0e78711ca0a67c5f1b5af69823b3a4021b27", "ja": "伝説の番組……？", "zh": "传说中的节目……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "a82398fcd7469bea0b1ab7bac9617edf6b6453d65c61da9172536e9d1055b16a", "ja": "ふふっ、ヒントは……。\nせんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！　です♪", "zh": "嘻嘻，提示是……  \n洗脑！制服！惊艳感！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7fd4fd334007574fd29e7e9ddb6b8fff0151a488a14a9bc21f65273f9aa99758", "ja": "あっ！？　そのフレーズは……！", "zh": "啊！？那句台词是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "15be017b291df676adba6693166cba02ee496ad631dc4315eca494f017a44ca5", "ja": "そう！　銀河系せーふく、\n子ども向けバラエティ『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』！", "zh": "没错！征服银河系，  \n儿童综艺《☆皮科皮科星球☆》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "9d2b8b3691428ade0efc0f115f4821323f4c26aa2479559d0a49999ece80206a", "ja": "このたび特別番組として、地球に帰還することに\nなったのだ！　いやー、めでたいね。", "zh": "这次作为特别节目，要返回地球了！哎呀，真是可喜可贺啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2b97bce616ed07f5d966ed2e7bca9ecf5c5c0443e88fbffc9ed46ab8d3d5aa4b", "ja": "丁度さっき、青羽さんと話してたんですよ。\nいい番組でしたね、って。", "zh": "刚才正好在和青羽小姐聊天呢。\n我说，那真是一档精彩的节目啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "6f4b6b2daeca94488b876f83fcf6ad5424ca9868ab443840a7f0e4aa83280f0e", "ja": "そういう大人のファンの声も、多かったそうです。\nだからこそのリバイバルなんでしょうね。", "zh": "听说也有不少成年粉丝发出了这样的感慨。正因为如此，才会重新播出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "3db410294d032ec35b8dc46e36c03b5a61de5bdf95030deee6463f8835dad0e1", "ja": "お子さんと一緒に見ていて『せんのー』された\nご両親も、多かったとか……。", "zh": "据说，也有不少和孩子一起看的家长，结果被“洗脑”了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "bca71ea93943bb2068697aab6d9c0323197e8f03254410170549ec61fbd9c5f3", "ja": "そうだね！　なにより、君の采配がよかった。\nメンバー選びが、カチッとハマッたね。", "zh": "是啊！最重要的是，你的安排很棒。成员选择也恰到好处呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "bcffc2f553fb6ddd3ce01d48f0d579e253aea99b0b36d2d254a68d7634b4c5a1", "ja": "木下ひなた君、箱崎星梨花君、大神環君、望月杏奈君！\nこの4人のおかげというのも、大きいだろう。", "zh": "木下日向、箱崎星梨花、大神环、望月杏奈！\n也有很大一部分要归功于这4个人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3cf1ef5f6ae52f7c33e0de1eec45dd32c82402937afcfef4718a577d8f39f0a0", "ja": "はい。みんな楽しんで仕事してくれましたから。\n今回の特別番組も、喜んでくれますよ！", "zh": "是的。因为大家都很开心地投入了工作。\n这次的特别节目，大家也一定会喜欢的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "91ecf2be2d269e9bf0dd1b93519ae04c54dc5c2b8db3855e657c6205d64ef145", "ja": "日本全国の、ミリオン星人ファンの子ども達も、\nきっと喜んでくれると思います♪", "zh": "日本全国喜欢百万星人的孩子们，也一定会很开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "49ac1b3e128fd4224378393a43fbfb18cb89db41a5c48453276bcf064459f2aa", "ja": "それと今回は、ちょっと大掛かりな企画が\n動いているとか……ですよね？　社長。", "zh": "另外这次，听说还在筹划一个规模不小的企划……对吧，社长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8c20a75267de7a241a201ca47160c017123bd44f500ac6b0baf2ac26fbfa72cf", "ja": "大掛かりな企画……それは？", "zh": "大规模的企划……是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "dea8d9b7a39eb1a7297ae71db0aad63880811a923de975935c861b50f86dfc9c", "ja": "うむ！　まだ各所との調整中だから、詳しくは\n追って知らせるが……宇宙関係、とだけ言っておこう！", "zh": "嗯！目前还在和各方协调，详细情况\n之后再通知大家……现在就先透露一句，和太空有关！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "e8276dabfd680443052eb07e4b1c185e9557bc699006bbc9d4adc2bc35f6ac5e", "ja": "宇宙関係！？　スケールが大きそうですね。\nわかりました、楽しみにしておきます。", "zh": "宇宙相关！？规模好像很大呢。\n我明白了，我会好好期待的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "fad3e368b7103d5bb6c8ec46376555e5e98146d7fc1651f50bdc7c0d188d6158", "ja": "うむ、ひとまずは企画を進めておいてくれたまえ。\nそれでは、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "嗯，总之就先把策划推进下去吧。\n那么，就拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "66da0be4e724c0c73aba6c3ae262185234ef78e0a248375d3e23f63aa3c5720c", "ja": "（全国の子どもたちと大人たちに、再び宇宙規模の夢を\n届けるために……プロデュース、頑張るぞ！）", "zh": "（为了再次给全国的孩子们和大人们带去宇宙规模的梦想……我要努力做好制作人的工作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
